# Play test of Crane Yard (CIPlay crane_yard, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe.
island Crane Yard
# DEEP 10-25: the spoil heap moved the land's centre (the recipe's save prints the exact offset)
offset -5.97 -7.33
expect step 0
expect title Lights On

# Up the pier's ladder from the sea, along the pier into the yard
climb 19 -3.15 h=0.3
expect stand 16 -1 h=5.66
walk 18 0 to 10 0 to 2 0 h=6.6 below=10
zone yard
expect step 0
read Foreman's whiteboard
expect step 1

# DEEP 10-25: the crane operator's tunnel in the spoil heap, his cache under the hatch
zone blastcave
expect step 2
read Crane operator Ben Okafor's note
expect step 3
use heaphatch
expect message The hatch lifts

# The spotlight without its parts; up the scaffold tower's ladder
use spotlight
expect message missing its lens
climb 6 -7.15 h=5.9
expect stand 4 -6 h=11.7

# The collapsed deck: the angler fish, three crates with the spotlight's parts
kill Angler fish
expect step 4
openat 26 -7
openat 30.5 4.5
openat 33 -1.5
expect story part 3
expect step 5

# The spotlight fixed: its beam, the buoy and the lockbox
expect hidden lockbox
use spotlight
expect message blazes on
expect story part 0
expect shown beam
expect shown buoy
expect shown lockbox
open Foreman's lockbox
expect item Placeable_RhinoSharkTrophy 1
expect done
